---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
---
<Page title="UK incident reporting guide | Relyxus" description="The FCA and PRA operational incident reporting rules that apply from 18 March 2027, explained side by side." path="/regulations/uk" tone="light" current="/solutions/banks">
  <section class="k-sec k-white uk-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="k-tag"><i class="d"></i>Guide, UK</span><h1 class="k-h1" style="margin-top:16px;max-width:980px">The new UK incident reports, <span>side by side.</span></h1><p class="k-lede">From 18 March 2027, firms report serious operational incidents to the FCA and, if dual regulated, the PRA. Here is what each expects, on two parallel tracks.</p></div></section>
  <section class="k-sec k-mist uk-tracks"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="tracks"><div class="tr fca"><b>FCA</b><span class="n n1"><i></i>Incident meets the threshold</span><span class="n n2"><i></i>Initial report, generally within 24 hours</span><span class="n n3"><i></i>Intermediate updates</span><span class="n n4"><i></i>Final report</span></div><div class="tr pra"><b>PRA</b><span class="n n1"><i></i>Incident meets the threshold</span><span class="n n2"><i></i>Initial report, generally within 24 hours</span><span class="n n3"><i></i>Intermediate updates</span><span class="n n4"><i></i>Final report</span></div></div>
    <p class="k-note">Summary of FCA PS26/2 and PRA PS7/26 as described by <a href="https://www.tlt.com/insights-and-events/insight/fca-and-pra-publish-final-rules-on-operational-incident-reporting-firms-have-to-ready-by-18-march-2027" style="text-decoration:underline">TLT</a>. Check the policy statements for the exact thresholds and timings that apply to your firm.</p></div></section>
</Page>
<style is:global>
.uk-hero{padding:96px 0 60px;background:radial-gradient(50% 60% at 90% 10%,rgba(127,160,214,.2),transparent 70%),#fff}
.uk-tracks .tracks{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}
.uk-tracks .tr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;align-items:center;position:relative;padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.uk-tracks .tr::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:126px;right:40px;top:50%;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3F66B0,#3DAE80)}.uk-tracks .pra::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5C4EE5,#3DAE80)}
.uk-tracks .tr b{font-family:var(--display);font-size:30px}
.uk-tracks .n{position:relative;z-index:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start}
.uk-tracks .n i{flex:none;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#3F66B0;margin-top:4px}.uk-tracks .n2 i{background:#FF6B4A;animation:r-ping 1.6s infinite}.uk-tracks .n4 i{background:#3DAE80}
@media (max-width:900px){.uk-tracks .tr{grid-template-columns:1fr}.uk-tracks .tr::before{display:none}}
</style>
